# EN: THE FEDERAL PACT, full redesign (22/9/2026, the vic3-journals skill), the same frame as the war
#     and the siege. Header: Pellegrini's "Cabildo y policia" (Buenos Aires, 1829, watercolour; public
#     domain), the seat of the mandate, with the count of delegating provinces on its band. One short
#     line; the thirteen provinces on the map; Buenos Aires facing the provinces that took the mandate
#     back (only while one stands as a country); the unanswered petitions (only while there are
#     grievances); Rosas's money for Oribe (only when there is somebody to receive it); the longer
#     account behind the arrow. Every line is backed by docs/guerra-grande-flujo/pacto-textos-mecanica.md.
#     Replaces gg_pact_map.gui and gg_pact_accounts.gui.
# ES: EL PACTO FEDERAL, rediseño completo, el mismo marco que la guerra y el sitio. Cabecera: «Cabildo y
#     policia» de Pellegrini (1829), la sede del encargo, con la cuenta de provincias que delegan en su
#     franja. Una linea corta; las trece provincias en el mapa; Buenos Aires frente a las provincias que
#     retiraron el encargo (solo mientras alguna sea pais); los pliegos sin atender (solo si hay
#     agravios); la plata de Rosas para Oribe (solo si hay quien la reciba); lo largo detras de la
#     flechita. Reemplaza gg_pact_map.gui y gg_pact_accounts.gui.
flowcontainer = {
	name = "gg_pact_overview"
	direction = vertical
	parentanchor = hcenter
	spacing = 16
	ignoreinvisible = yes
	# EN/ES: the header with the count on its band / la cabecera con la cuenta en su franja
	widget = {
		size = { 520 246 }
		parentanchor = hcenter
		icon = { size = { 520 240 } position = { 0 6 } texture = "gfx/interface/gg_situations/pact_header.dds" }
		textbox = {
			position = { 0 206 } size = { 520 40 }
			background = { using = dark_area alpha = 0.85 }
			using = fontsize_large align = center|nobaseline
			text = "gg_pact_j_band"
			tooltip = "gg_pact_j_band_tt"
		}
	}
	textbox = {
		autoresize = yes multiline = yes
		minimumsize = { 480 -1 } maximumsize = { 480 -1 }
		parentanchor = hcenter
		using = fontsize_medium align = center|nobaseline
		text = "gg_pact_j_short"
	}
	textbox = {
		size = { 520 34 }
		parentanchor = hcenter
		using = fontsize_large align = center|nobaseline
		background = { using = entry_bg_fancy_dark alpha = 0.6 }
		text = "gg_pact_j_sec_map"
	}
	# EN/ES: the thirteen, each in its own colour; hover a province for its state / las trece, cada una en su color
	widget = {
